Package: spaced-nm-focus
Version: 10.26.1-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Spaced Linux Team
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0t64, network-manager-applet
Description: Focus the password field in nm-applet's Wi-Fi dialogs
 A GTK 3 module, loaded only into nm-applet, that puts the cursor in the
 password field when a Wi-Fi network asks for one. libnma 1.10 no longer
 focuses that field itself.
